<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-15T17:13:34.972Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:13:34 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Houthis have stepped up attacks on Saudi Arabia, attempting strikes on dozens of Saudi facilities and launching missiles that killed two ministers at Yemen's presidential palace in Aden, while Saudi-led coalition forces intercepted missiles and said they repelled further Houthi attempts. In Yemen, fighting around Taiz threatens civilian lifelines and aid deliveries, and Houthi threats to hit Saudi targets again have rattled Gulf markets. The group also denied targeting the holy city of Medina after Saudi claims of an intercepted missile. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNaWh0TXl6UklZTEFnWFFkXy0teUtxZ0dEOUJMb3BzbHR6MFFXcENBV1FQYkw4YzlMR0ZadVNiTnpQbVB1YmZuaE5kcm5nNzhCS2NTT2lBWVd0N2FzVy0zV21tckJZU3NFNkRfVWtYN3pJQTRWaWZzTGZSTHVlZGIyQVhFOVlkcllfOGlyOVJ2UVNaVGp4cGc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQWFJPaFEtMXN4ZWhQY0w5bUNGZWREUTVXcEJxWUdDOEJveWFtcjRHS1dlMVRXOGRrRGpsYm5xbUFUNTVQcnVLZEo3d0NReVcyek5hMWlwYklDVUtyQ0pqX2h1Nnp2UmYtUzZKXzVSanM0ZnNRTUlXZFdQTHNsSkZOb0xsZ1R3VUxBSzJNaUV5ZkRkSk5rY1JJWlNaTTRKUVdsRnpWMGNkSk4zajBLczJaUA?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNc3h1eG1hcERjZmUxWG4ybWdlWVBRMVFFTTZrNlhhTUw4ZUEtVUU1UU5qS3hMMlNBSmpqbGJlR05YVkJQbmRBQmhkWmVTaXY1X1NpVDRQNWcxeDh2YzFJemJ0eElsaFhxY3NvNERuVkVzUl9PQWNWS2t4QmctcEVmQnRiUWMyRXFUaE1BNEIxQUJkMXBQZG5ucFpVVzdEQm0zcmlZU1FJcEdJOGVPbDU0dDRKQTE4QWJjUTF2dTZnWGMtZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPLVFrZjlLdTluanZGNHBrQ09EMGM2Tk5TSlRENGZ6OVU1WkRENDZ0ejBDX3Vxdm02bk5aX2kwYmh5NmJvWk5KUEVTWXRTVTllX0RMNDFxa0NnbmN0WTQ5TWhJYzh5OEl4NVZNTk45b2U2dV80aHljMzNhX